      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[... And it rea]ched, after payment of a debt and the redemption of</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] sixty-two and one half din. and a string of beads</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">of [a]mber divided by balls of interlaced gold,\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">its middle interlaced gold, an estimate of its value being</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">thirty-[f]ive din., my inheritance in Al-Mu\u02bfizziya Cairo</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">at the Khal\u012bj. And when this had been confirmed, I sent</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">to Ashkelon and I produced a legal record verifying</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">what I had said concerning [t]he mar[r]iage, and [on] it are aff[ixed]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the signatures of the permanent \u1e25averim in [A]shkelon [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">They are those who have been entrusted with renewing the marriage, writing the marriage contract,\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[and t]he betrothal. I am hereby presenting it in the presence of</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">... and in your presence. And he presented us with a legal record</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">written in Ashkelon \\\\which contains a copy of the marriage contracts//. And this is its text, word\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for word: That which took place in our presence, we the witnesses</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">who have signed our testimony below on this deed.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Thus occurred: (His) h(onor), g(reatness and) h(oliness) (our) master and l(ord) Shelah, the honored prince,\u00a0 </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
